flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7002453Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7002666Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7002768Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7002868Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7003319Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7003461Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7003628Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7004006Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7004164Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7004346Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7004621Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7004931Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7005196Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7005324Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7005447Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7005650Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7005799Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7006082Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7006183Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7006256Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7006383Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7006645Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
