flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7012719Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:21:20.7012925Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
